// Axon v5.0 Self-Hosted Compiler — Token, AST, Type & Arena Definitions (`compiler_ax/tokens_ast.ax`)
// 100% Pure Axon, Zero GC, Zero External Crates. All hot helpers use <= 4 1-slot args (Win64 Register ABI).

